{c: Verse 1}
[Eb]Aum mangalam Bhagwan vishnu,        [Bb]Mangalam garu [Eb]da dhwaja
[Eb]Aum mangalam kundari [Bb]kaksham,        mangakay ta [Eb]nohari
[Eb]Aaj I [Bb]baadat,        [Eb]Aaj I [Bb]baadat [F]Rubaru [Eb]Ho gayi
[Bb]Jo man [Eb]gi thi..... [Bb] ...        [Bb]Jo man [Eb]gi thi
[Bb]us du [Eb]aa sang [Bb]guftagu [Eb]ho gayi,        Mere mau [Ab]la Mere mau [Bb]la.. [Eb] ..
Mere mau [Ab]la Mere mau [Bb]la.. [Eb] ..        Te [F]ra... [Bb] .. Shukri [Eb]ya
[Eb]Aaj I [Bb]baadat [F]Rubaru [Eb]Ho gayi,        [Ab]Dard ke andhero se
[Bb]aa gaye u [Eb]jaalo me,        [Gm]Ishq ke charago ka
[F]noor hai kha [Bb]yalo me,        [Ab]Dard ke andhero se
[Bb]aa gaye u [Eb]jaalo me,        [Gm]Ishq ke charago ka
[F]noor hai kha [Bb]yalo me,        [Bb]Nazro se teri
chaak [Eb]dil pe raffu [Ab]ho gayi,        [Bb]dil pe raffu [Eb]ho gayi
